---
title: Opening a document and its outline
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Reader
  participant Workspace as Reading workspace
  participant Catalog as Document catalog
  participant Store as Document store

  Reader->>Workspace: Open a document
  Workspace->>Catalog: Find the document description
  Catalog-->>Workspace: Description or missing result
  alt Document exists
    par Load text
      Workspace->>Store: Retrieve document text
      Store-->>Workspace: Text and section identifiers
    and Load outline
      Workspace->>Catalog: Retrieve section headings
      Catalog-->>Workspace: Ordered outline
    end
    Workspace-->>Reader: Display text with its outline
  else Document is missing
    Workspace-->>Reader: Display an empty reading view
  end
